      Ours & 5.06/\underline{3.61} & \textbf{3.99}/\textbf{3.16} & \textbf{0.37}/\textbf{0.31} & \textbf{0.22}/\underline{0.18} & \textbf{0.92}/\textbf{0.94} \\
