In this paper, we answer this question by showing that  $\nsid \lesssim n^* \max \left( 1, \frac{\log n^*}{D}\right)$ for almost the entire range of interest of the parameters, specifically, for any $\pi \le 1/2$ and any $\delta \le \pi/16$. Indeed, we show a slightly stronger upper bound that is complemented by a matching lower bound obtained by constructing a worst-case pair of distributions;
see \Cref{thm: sc_D}.
