That's a good sign.

What can I put in \ensuremath{\highlight{goal}{\textbf\{\,~~\,\textbf\}_{\kern1pt\textbf{7}}}}?
Prompted by the success with \ensuremath{\highlight{goal}{\textbf\{\,~~\,\textbf\}_{\kern1pt\textbf{6}}}}, I try the induction hypothesis for~\ensuremath{\Var u}:
\begin{hscode}\SaveRestoreHook
\column{B}{@{}>{\hspre}l<{\hspost}@{}}%
\column{E}{@{}>{\hspre}l<{\hspost}@{}}%
