For the \texttt{ingredient\_statement} attribute, we added supplementary instructions directly within the field description to guide the model’s output. Embedding such instructions directly into the schema improves the clarity and consistency of the expected output. This design ensures that the LLM receives precise, field-level guidance from the schema itself - reducing ambiguity and increasing the accuracy and reliability of the generated responses.




